            here: "The provisioner leans on a counter stacked with loaves, packs and folded cloth, calling out prices.",
            description: "A round, red-cheeked man in a leather apron, with a pencil behind one ear and a ledger he never lets out of reach. He can tell you to the copper what anything in the market is worth, and what he\'ll pay for it, which is less.",
            race: "human",
            attributes: {
                Charisma: 4,
            },
            skills: {
                "trade:haggling": 4,
            },
            tags: [
